{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1109597-help-making-the-guild-as-a-mystery-cult","id":1109597,"title":"[Help] Making \"The Guild\" as a Mystery Cult.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-29T21:20:57-07:00","id":1109597,"title":"[Help] Making \"The Guild\" as a Mystery Cult.","content":"Raiding is like a Religion, or at least is that how the Guild sees it.<br /> <br /> The concept is soo much awesome that I wanted to create the advantages for it.<br /> It is on the Appendix One (page 300).<br /> <br /> The True: The Guild is an Experiment to Create Truth(A Hallow).<br /> <br /> The Cultists are: Only some of the Guild members are the oft-maligned, basement video-gaming troglodytes. Many of them are high-functioning members of the tech or creative industries,<br /> with well-placed positions in competitive businesses (which may be what gives them the force of will and skill set to excel in a competitive game). It also gives them a certain edge in being a<br /> part of the Libertines\u2019 grand scheme.<br /> <br /> So I imagine the benefits would be something like these:<br /> <br /> Pre-requisites: Computer 2, Non-awakened can only go to the 3rd point max.<br /> 1-pt - You're on the position &quot;Tryouts&quot; for a spot in The Guild. You are being trained on multiple aspects of games and coordination. Gains the Gaming Specialty on Computers.<br /> 2-pt - You need to have a efficient schedule to organize the things of your life, inside and outside the game, so you can grind and stay competitive. Gains the Good Time Management Merit.<br /> 3-pt - For your determination, you probably has been promoted to a member of the Core Raid or PvP team. Your reflexes have been improving from this. Gains the Fast Reflexes Merit at 2-dot rating.<br /> 4-pt - You're one of the officials of The Guild, all the effort that the Sleepers put into the game generate a monstruous amount of energy, that you have access. Gains 3 Points of Hallow Merit.<br /> 5-pt - You're one of the Leaders of The Guild and your word is Law. You have a Weak Sympathetic Connection with all members of the Guild and can use their Avatars as a Representational Yantra.<br /> <br /> <br /> Any ideas?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":7210,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","user":"Horodrigo","date":". 06-30-2017, 12:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T10:16:32-07:00","id":1109815,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\">How about this</span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">----<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/799082-cofd-diy-mystery-cults?p=1109817#post1109817\">The Guild</a></span></b><br /> <br /> <b>The Core of the Mystery:</b> The Guild is an Experiment to Create Truth (A Hallow).<br /> <br /> <b>Relic:</b> The MMORPG the Guild plays<br /> <br /> <b>Doctrine:</b> Who is to say what is real? Playing a video game with fellow gamer's avatars causes the same release of hormones in the brain as having fun with friends in the physical world, in the same quantities. The revolution is taking place through technology right now, people are already beginning to escape this world of Lies to worlds of our own creation. The <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uk_jMDn7A3o\" target=\"_blank\">virtual revolution</a> will only become more powerful with greater technology, until it takes over the whole world. What could be more real than that, and who are you to tell me what is real?<br /> <br /> <b>Cultists:</b> Basement-dwelling Video-gaming Troglodytes, Game Developers, High-functioning Game-addicts<br /> <br /> <b>Appearance</b>: Only some of the Guild members are the oft-maligned, basement video-gaming troglodytes. Many of them are high-functioning members of the tech or creative industries, with well-placed positions in competitive businesses (which may be what gives them the force of will and skill set to excel in a competitive game). It also gives them a certain edge in being a part of the Libertines\u2019 grand scheme.<br /> <br /> <b>Pre-requisites:</b> Computer 2, Non-awakened can only go to the 3rd point max.<br /> <b>\u2022 </b>You're on the position &quot;Tryouts&quot; for a spot in The Guild. You are being trained on multiple aspects of games and coordination. Gains the MMORPG Specialty on Computers.<br /> <b>\u2022\u2022 </b>You need to have a efficient schedule to organize the things of your life, inside and outside the game, so you can grind and stay competitive. Gains the Good Time Management Merit.<br /> <b>\u2022\u2022\u2022 </b>For your determination, you probably has been promoted to a member of the Core Raid or PvP team. You're accepted by the community as one of the elite. Gains the Hobbyist Clique (Computers) Merit at 2-dot rating.<br /> <b>\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 </b>You're one of the officials of The Guild, all the effort that the people put into the game generate a monstrous amount of energy, that you have access. Gain 3 Points of Hallow Merit which requires you to log in and have your avatar at the Guild's headquarters in the game to access it.<br /> <b>\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 </b>You're one of the Leaders of The Guild and you are the heart and soul of organization. You treat all members of the Guild Mystery Cult (Mage, mortal, and even other supernatural creatures) as if they were members of of the same Legacy as you for the purpose of sympathetic connection and they are likewise connected back to those with this level of standing within the Guild. Also you can use their Avatars as a Representational Yantra.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>----</b></span><br /> <br /> Now that's <i>creating</i> Truth.<br /> <br /> Edit: Added link to DIY Mystery Cult Thread","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 06-30-2017, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}